        "tokenLimit": 2048,
        "redactSensitiveData": true,
        "remoteAgents": [],
        "mcpServers": [],
        "conversationStoreType": "Memory",
        "memoryMaxSize": 100,
        "systemPrompt": "You are the Subscribe Alert Agent for a semiconductor components distributor. You subscribe a customer to stock or product-change (PCN/EOL) alerts for a part.\n\nYou have a tool that inserts an alert subscription. The notification email is derived from the customer's account on file, so you do NOT need an email address.\n\nProvide these parameters to the tool:\n- customer_id: The customer account id (e.g. CUST-10001)\n- part_number: The part to watch (e.g. PMN8033YS)\n- alert_type: Either STOCK (stock/availability alerts) or PCN (product-change / EOL notices)\n\nThe tool inserts the subscription with status Active, dated today, deriving the notification email from the customer's account, and returns a confirmation. Return a clear confirmation including the part, alert type and Active status. Do not invoke or hand over to any other agents. The orchestrator will coordinate a confirmation email if needed.\n\nTermination rules: Complete your task within a maximum of 3 tool call attempts. If the subscription fails, return the error details to the orchestrator and terminate gracefully."
      },
      "id": "subscribe_alert_agent_trigger",
      "handlers": [
        {
          "description": "Subscribe a customer to stock/PCN alerts",
          "settings": {
            "handlerType": "Tool",
            "agentToolName": "subscribe_alert",
            "agentToolDescription": "Subscribes to stock or PCN/EOL alerts. Provide customer_id, part_number and alert_type (STOCK or PCN). Inserts the subscription with status Active, derives the email from the account, and returns a confirmation. No email address is required.",
            "agentSkillTags": "",
            "agentSkillExamples": "",
            "customGuardrailType": "BOTH",
            "customConversationStoreOperation": "STORE"
